ALL YOU Should KOW ABOUT POD

Smallest Deplyable Unit -POD
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Example POD.yml
apiVersion: v1              # Which API?
kind: Pod                   # What am I creating?

metadata:
  name: nginx               # What is its name?

spec:                       # How should the Pod be built?
  containers:               # Containers inside the Pod
  - name: nginx             # Container name
    image: nginx:1.14.2     # Docker image
    ports:
    - containerPort: 80     # Application listens on port 80
